    "title": "'Lost everything': NKY community rallies around family of 5 involved in devastating fire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Arnold, WKRC ,\n10 hours ago UNION, Ky. (WKRC) — People in Boone County are rallying around the Caudill family. The family escaped a fire at their home on Sunday with only the clothes on their backs. \"They lost their animals. They lost everything,\" said Gary Williams, owner of Gary Williams' Martial Arts. \"Leo, I guess he was on the second floor; he had to jump out of the window, and the dad had to catch him.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
